# Smash the Orcish Scouts (San d'Oria 1-1): Grilau in Northern San d'Oria. A level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria holding an
# Orcish Axe and no mission. Section 1: Grilau plays 1000; its finish with option 0 begins the mission (Northern San
# d'Oria's own registration, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION). Section 3: Grilau plays ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET; the Axe traded:
# 1020, whose finish completes it. Section 2: Grilau's script plays 1009; its finish with option 0 begins it again; the
# Axe traded: 1002, whose finish completes it again. Rival zone-in, another mission's script: the login in Northern San
# d'Oria plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West onZoneIn, which returns 878 (the trace records only that
# return, with no event packet).
lists NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrade NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1000 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1020 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1002
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=-240.5,7,57.9 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
item OrcishAxe
login
trigger Grilau                          # section 1: 1000
finish option=0                         # begun
trigger Grilau                          # section 3: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET
walk -241.5,7,57.9
trade Grilau OrcishAxe x1               # 1020
finish                                  # completed; the axe taken
trigger Grilau                          # section 2: his script's 1009
finish option=0                         # begun again
item OrcishAxe
trade Grilau OrcishAxe x1               # 1002
finish                                  # completed again
